| **2** | **The Ritz‑Carlton, Berlin** | 3‑minute walk | Deluxe King | **€240 – €380** | 9.0 / 10 | Modern elegance, superb service, close to Tiergarten & Gate. |
| **3** | **Motel One Berlin‑Hauptbahnhof** | 5‑minute walk | Superior Double | **€110 – €150** | 8.5 / 10 | Stylish boutique, great value, rooftop terrace with city views. |
